  (text "EastRising ER-TFT035IPS-6 (ILI9488, 4-wire SPI). Its 50-pin FPC folds under the panel into J3 (ZIF)."
    (at 160.02 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "a6a083ab-9413-4105-bb32-536ddddc7eb2"))

  (text "J3 pin j is panel pin 51 - j. Unused bus pins as the datasheet says: DB0-17 and RGB low, RD and IM2-0 high."
    (at 162.56 19 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "e8a27763-17ed-493d-ba0d-9f9af1521afc"))

  (text "U6 AP3156: three sinks per cathode pin (LED_K1, LED_K2), 20 mA per LED at most, set over SDI (1-wire)."
    (at 160.02 23 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "62d8c31f-c388-4563-a90d-0a43fa2d17c0"))

